ANZZ DEV Registry Signatures

This directory contains documentation for registry signature verification.

Security policy

The registry signature mechanism will use Ed25519 digital signatures.

- The private signing key must remain in a secure, owner-controlled environment.
- Never upload the private signing key to this repository.
- The public verification key may be included in the client application.
- Clients must reject registries with missing or invalid signatures.
- Clients must fail closed if signature verification cannot be completed.

Current status

Signature generation and verification have not been implemented yet.

Do not treat the current registry as cryptographically verified until the signing mechanism is implemented.
